-speaker","baseline":{"text":"钟声响彻着。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1f2","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f2"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在教堂前把车停下后，和我一起下车的姬子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-263","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-263"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「濑津美，不要再来看望我了喔。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2cc","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2cc"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…唉？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2ef","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2ef"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"突然地话语。\n意味着，不会再见…永别的意思吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-395","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-395"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…那个，这种时候我…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-40c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-40c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…被留下来的人，该怎么做才好？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-489","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-489"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「不怎么…跟平时一样就可以了喔。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-4fa","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4fa"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…再说的，具体一点吧。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-56b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-56b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「就像说的那样，普普通通地，自然地活下去。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-5aa","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-5aa"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"明明亲近的人，再过不久就要去世了，\n明明已经不能再见…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-61a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-61a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在这里被留下的人，能够普通的活下去吗…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-6a3","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-6a3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…不要说，这么困难的事啊。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-71c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-71c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「那么，笑着为我送行吧。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-795","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-795"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「………………」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-7fe","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-7fe"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「更加困难了…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-82d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-82d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后，背对我，\n往面前的教堂踏出脚步的姬子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-89d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-89d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…朝着那个背影…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-8c4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-8c4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我问出了最后的问题。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-962","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-962"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「姬子…最后再告诉我一件事吧。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-9df","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-9df"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…可以的。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-a47","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a47"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「尼洛…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-aad","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-aad"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…阿洛伊斯……是幸福的吗？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-b24","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b24"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……………」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-b5b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b5b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"对于这个问题，沉默着低下头去的姬子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-bb8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-bb8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…不一会儿…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-beb","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-beb"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"凝视了教堂一会儿后…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-c1e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c1e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"再次仰望起天空…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-c8b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c8b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「谁知道呢，是怎样的呢…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-d00","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d00"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「哈哈，有点不太清楚呢。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-d49","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d49"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这样说完露出了笑容。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-d94","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d94"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"明明再过不久，就会从这个世界上消失的她…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-df1","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-df1"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…在最后，也露出了平常的笑容…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-e97","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e97"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「那么…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-f00","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f00"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…再见了……可乐饼博士…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-f8f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f8f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…就这样…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-fc4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-fc4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"相处长达40个夏日的朋友，消失在了7楼…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-101d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-101d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"名字是姬子，“辉夜姬”的姬，“小孩子”的子，\n血型AB型，23岁，天秤座，女性。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-10a7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-10a7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"塑料识别手环的颜色是白色。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1153","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1153"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"1999年，世界人口总数达到10亿人的，\n天主信徒的其中一人消失了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1205","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1205"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「为我取了奇怪的外号…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1278","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1278"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「施予了不可思议的魔法…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-12e9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-12e9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…从这个世界中也…消失了…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-139e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-139e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"仰望着高高在上的太阳，响彻教堂的钟声。\n一望无际的青空，嘈杂的蝉鸣。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1432","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1432"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"再过不久夏天就要结束了…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-147b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-147b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过今天…似乎还是很热的样子…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-171e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-171e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"漫长的夏日结束…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1751","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1751"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"很快的秋天也过了，\n迎来了街上播放圣诞歌的时候，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-17d9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-17d9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"叩叩，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1822","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1822"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「濑津美，收到东西了喔。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1885","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1885"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊，嗯…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-18aa","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-18aa"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"从妈妈那接过邮递包裹。\n一般的想，是不会有人寄东西给我的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1920","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1920"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过我，稍微有一些头绪。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1967","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1967"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"指定寄送日期的小包裹的寄信人。\n边想着或许是，边拿过来确认着…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1a01","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a01"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…阿洛伊斯…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1a22","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a22"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"用圆珠笔写下的小小的字。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1a59","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a59"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…是姬子寄来的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1a86","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a86"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"生前，虽然不知道是何时寄出的，\n不过说过要送我其他的东西。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1afe","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1afe"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后，小心翼翼地…\n伴随着期待和同样的不安打开了…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1bf7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1bf7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…连衣裙？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1c20","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1c20"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"夏天风格的纯白底色，绘有可爱的黄色向日葵。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1c5f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1c5f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这是以前，说过好几次要买给我，\n我也蛮想要的东西。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1cd7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1cd7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"拿到手上摊开的连衣裙，\n窗边衣架上刚洗好的睡衣。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1d41","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1d41"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…还有，现在正穿着的水手服。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1d7a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1d7a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"作为过去日常生活的证明的，\n唯一的，我所持有的睡衣以外的衣服…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1e1c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1e1c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…心…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1e43","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1e43"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"动摇着…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1e78","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1e78"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虽然很开心，不由得想起穿起来试试看。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1ecf","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1ecf"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…不过，我停下了手。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1f14","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f14"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后，再次放回箱子内，\n前往更“适合”收下的人所在的地方。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-1fbd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1fbd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"叮，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2020","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2020"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"隔了数月再来到这个地方。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2057","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2057"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"经过了护士的值班室旁边，\n寻找着她的身影，不过却哪里都找不到。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-20d7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-20d7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后，在曾经的姬子的病房门前，\n理所当然的，写着不曾知道的名字的门牌。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2149","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2149"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"和坐在轮椅上的老奶奶轻轻地打声招呼后，\n我离开了7楼。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-21dd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-21dd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"回去的途中，\n不经意间注意到中庭。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2223","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2223"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那里，有着零零落落开放着的水仙。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2262","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2262"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在花坛的其它地方正化作荒野的这个季节，\n水仙一枝独放的姿态，让人感到凛然之美。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2335","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2335"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"钟声响彻着，\n从与姬子告别以来，再次来到了这里。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-23c6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-23c6"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后，和寻找到的那个人对话。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2435","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2435"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「千寻…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2486","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2486"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊，濑津美…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-24de","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-24de"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「好久不见呢，来到这个地方有事么？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-254b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-254b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…在医院没看见你在。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-25a9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-25a9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊…已经辞去了陪护的工作。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2615","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2615"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「在心情冷静下来之前，稍微休息一下。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-2660","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2660"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这样说着，一如往常的，稳重的表情。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-26ad","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-26ad"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"从那个表情中…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-26c8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-26c8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我想，说不定我已没有义务了吧。\n已经不需要代替她去抱怨了吧，就如被嘱咐的那样。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_19\",\"main\"]/mjo-277f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/